Note about integration:

Necessary files from FatFs from ChaN for integration in nodeflight.
Since some files needs to be modified for integration, the library is not included in its entirety.

Version: R0.16 with patch 2 (ff16p1.diff and ff16p2.diff applied to ff.c,
from http://elm-chan.org/fsw/ff/patches.html). The configuration, ffconf.h,
and the system functions, ffsystem.c, are in src/integration/fatfs.

Note: Files are converted to match unix line breaks from the repo.

More information about original library:
http://elm-chan.org/fsw/ff/00index_e.html
